# Freshservice status

## Honesty

- Do not mark **Resolved** / **Closed** without evidence the ask is done.
- Pending ≠ resolved. Say what is waiting (user reply, vendor, change window).
- Never invent priority, group, or assignee — only set values the user named
  or the ticket already has.
- Transitions: prefer MCP status/update tools; report the resulting state.
